{"folder":null,"name":"Banu Haqim","type":"clan","_id":"0vMzpMywTiWvzZkR","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/BanuHaqim_Symbol.png","system":{"description":"<p>Known to be adept killers, these vampires have assumed the role of vigilantes, judges, and executioners among their brethren.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-banu-haqim","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"18"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["bloodSorcery","celerity","obfuscate"]},"effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-banu-haqim"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518559,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ventrue","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>Self-proclaimed the Clan of Kings, these vampires were always involved with the ruling class throughout history, thanks to their ability to manipulate the minds and emotions of their subjects.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-ventrue","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["dominate","fortitude","presence"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-ventrue"}},"_id":"75eIw4kjVx8Wx5NW","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Ventrue_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518562,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Toreador","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>A clan of passionate artists, tastemakers, critics, and others who embody beauty and creation. Passion and obsession for beauty run in their veins.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-toreador","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["auspex","celerity","presence"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-toreador"}},"_id":"AKVUE4EKsmJZqwGh","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Toreador_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518562,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Lasombra","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>The hidden hand in the shadows that manipulates people like pieces on a chessboard. Masters of manipulation and deception, these vampires would go to any lengths to secure what they want.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-lasombra","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"18"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["dominate","potence","corruption","oblivion"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-lasombra"}},"_id":"FjBtOu2a919qZ0Jp","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Lasombra_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Giovanni","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>Vampires obsessed with death and the exploitation of its ramifications. Members of this clan are known to dabble in necromantic rituals and to deal with other undead creatures.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-giovanni","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"18"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["auspex","potence","necromancy"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-giovanni"}},"_id":"PPBJ2g6pElWVbciq","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Hecata_Symbol_Modern.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518559,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Tremere","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>These vampires were once mages who used magic to steal the curse of vampirism in the hopes of achieving immortality. Now their sorcery is bound by blood, and they study tirelessly to perfect their craft.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-tremere","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["auspex","dominate","bloodSorcery","necromancy"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-tremere"}},"_id":"WMWtyNh82m1x3iQV","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Tremere_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518562,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ravnos","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>Survivors, travelers, and deceivers. The clan seeks truth through lies and is recovering from a great loss, as many of its members were consumed by their own ancestors.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-ravnos","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["obfuscate","presence","tellurgy"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-ravnos"}},"_id":"YBuh2kTcbZorJNmp","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Ravnos_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"folder":null,"name":"Brujah","type":"clan","_id":"YwahZhBaFC6nTFAG","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/VTM_Brujah_Symbol.png","system":{"description":"<p>Rebels, revolutionaries, extremists, and troublemakers. Their blood burns with the desire for change and an almost uncontrollable rage.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-brujah","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"18"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["celerity","potence","presence"]},"effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-brujah"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518559,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"folder":null,"name":"Gangrel","type":"clan","_id":"bgdoh21Cohv7V811","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Gangrel_Symbol.png","system":{"description":"<p>Lone survivors who are proud to be closer to beasts than humans and other vampires. Members of this clan are some of the few undead who can call the wilds home.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-gangrel","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"18"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["animalism","celerity","fortitude"]},"effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-gangrel"}},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518559,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Malkavian","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>With their unique minds that can see beyond reality, these vampires are unified in an otherworldly network that allows them to share knowledge and visions.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-malkavian","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"18"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["auspex","dominate","obfuscate"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-malkavian"}},"_id":"nJFG4DywpOyTxcxO","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/VTM_Malkavian_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Salubri","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>A clan divided into two castes: the healers who seek redemption through service, and the warriors who seek revenge on their persecutors.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-salubri","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["auspex","fortitude","obfuscate"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-salubri"}},"_id":"nXqBzCv463973gu8","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Salubri_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Caitiff","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>Also known as the Clanless, these vampires are a mixed bag who don’t bear clear signs that they are descended from any of the 14 major clans. They are often viewed as little more than stray dogs by their kin.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-caitiff","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":[]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-caitiff"}},"_id":"o67I5InThqn02T87","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Caitiff_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518561,"modifiedTime":1785917518562,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Nosferatu","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>The clan of secrets, information, and stealth. They can’t hide their monstrous nature as other vampires can, but they are experts in hiding everything else, and in discovering what everyone else hides.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-nosferatu","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["animalism","obfuscate","potence"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-nosferatu"}},"_id":"suoNPC239i7Wa2s9","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Nosferatu_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ministry","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>Liberators, corruptors, and preachers of self-discovery and freedom. These vampires believe that the only way to freedom is through liberating oneself from one’s own bonds.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-ministry","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"18"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["corruption","obfuscate","presence"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-ministry"}},"_id":"xE4CHv9xkW5RnMjF","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/TheMinistry_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518561,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
{"name":"Tzimisce","type":"clan","folder":null,"system":{"description":"<p>Obsessed with ownership and transformation, this clan strives to bring the world, and the very flesh of those within it, under their control and design.</p>","dataItemId":"clan-tzimisce","source":{"book":"VTM Alpha 1.0 Player Packet","page":"19"},"curse":{"name":"","description":""},"beast":{"name":"","description":""},"frenzy":{"name":"","description":""},"disciplines":["animalism","dominate","tellurgy","vicissitude"]},"effects":[],"flags":{"wod6e":{"dataItemId":"clan-tzimisce"}},"_id":"yQ6W2oB7zsZiLQ7J","img":"systems/wod6e/assets/dark-pack/clans/Tzimisce_Symbol.png","ownership":{"default":0,"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg":3},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.365","systemId":"wod6e","systemVersion":"1.0.0","createdTime":1785917518560,"modifiedTime":1785917518562,"lastModifiedBy":"1zv0dP0UuKLsyiZg","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"sort":0}
